@baseUrl = https://localhost:8080

### List all items peding
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/item/peding

### List all items preparing
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/item/preparing

### Initializing preparation for item
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/item/1/prepared

### Mark item as ready
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/item/1/ready

### Mark item as despatched
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/item/1/despatched

//FIXME - Move this section to the food delivery section.
### Mark item as delivered
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/item/1/ready